    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "phad::io / sync / camera",
      "items": [
        "io：EuRoC/TUM adapter → 统一 SensorEvent；open 全量校验",
        "sync：StereoPairSynchronizer 左右配对；io ⊥ sync",
        "camera：StereoRectifier + RectifiedStereoCalibration"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "frontend + apps/ 编排",
      "items": [
        "frontend：GFTT + LK + 1D SAD；只出 FrameTracks",
        "session：isKeyframe（视差/时间/率）+ update 循环 + cull→dropTracks",
        "glue：kValid / kNoRightMatch → VioMeasurement（无 frontend 依赖）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "phad::estimator 内部",
      "items": [
        "update：校验 → PnP → 窗口 LM → cull/reopt → segment_id",
        "GenericStereo/mono factor；visual support / coast（M4）",
        "GTSAM PIMPL；26 列 diag — 见 phad/estimator/README.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "信任与旁路",
      "items": [
        "数据集不可信；GT 只读、不进因子图",
        "eval / viz / bench 消费 Trajectory，不回写状态",
        "OpenCV / GTSAM PRIVATE，不泄漏 public header"
      ]
    }
  ]
